      "name": "金享導覽員",
      "role": "虛擬導覽",
      "autoPlayIntro": true,
      "intro": "歡迎來到 LOGO 雷射與貼標生產線。本產線整合雷射打標與貼標作業，用於零件 LOGO、型號、序號標示，配置於組裝後段，適用自行車五金。核心模組包含工作台、雷射打標機、貼標輔助治具與檢驗工位。工藝流程為：工件人工上料，人工定位擺放，雷射刻印 LOGO 或人工貼上 LOGO 標籤，再由人工檢測標示位置與清晰度，NG 品分離後出料。兩種工藝可單獨或搭配使用。",
      "introEn": "Welcome to the LOGO laser and labeling production line. This line integrates laser marking and labeling operations for marking part logos, model numbers and serial numbers. Deployed at the post-assembly stage, it is suitable for mass production of bicycle metal hardware. Core modules include the worktable, laser marker, labeling auxiliary fixtures and an inspection station. The process flow: manual loading of workpieces, manual positioning and placement, laser-engraved logo or manual logo label application, manual inspection of marking position and clarity, separation of non-conforming products, and discharge. The two processes can be operated independently or in combination."
    },
