    "guide": {
      "enabled": true,
      "name": "金享導覽員",
      "role": "虛擬導覽",
      "autoPlayIntro": true,
      "intro": "這裡是噴砂區。噴砂為工件表面處理工序，配置於加工後、塗裝與陽極處理前，適用自行車五金金屬零配件。核心模組包含噴砂機、砂材儲存回收系統、除塵設備與作業工作台。工藝流程為：工件人工上料，擺放定位，噴砂介質衝擊工件表面，去除毛邊、氧化皮與油污，形成均勻霧面粗化，清理粉塵後工件下料。可調整砂材粒度與氣壓，改變表面粗糙度，提升後續陽極、烤漆附著力，滿足外觀及後續製程要求。",
      "introEn": "This is the sandblasting area. Sandblasting is a workpiece surface-treatment process, performed after machining and prior to painting and anodizing, and applies to metal hardware components for bicycles. Core modules include the sandblasting machine, abrasive storage and recycling system, dust-removal equipment and worktable. The process flow: manual workpiece loading, positioning and placement, abrasive media impinges on the workpiece surface to remove burrs, scale and oil contamination for uniform matte surface roughening, followed by dust cleaning and workpiece unloading. Abrasive grain size and air pressure are adjustable to modify surface roughness, improving adhesion for subsequent anodizing and painting to satisfy appearance and downstream process requirements."
    },
